# Agent tooling creates git worktrees here, INSIDE the repo. Each is a full
# checkout, so without this a `git add -A` commits them as embedded gitlinks
# and a root-level `vitest run` collects a second copy of the whole suite.
# vitest.config.js excludes the same path for the second half of that.
.claude/worktrees/
